e\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb S\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb S\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>下列有限数据表完整编码附件现存正文“历史：2026-10-23余下483篇全文续审”中声称的计数。各字段表示“该摘要记录的数字”，不是本次文件实际数量、已完成审阅次数或证明资格。表格字面数据是本定义的全部输入，不读取缺失报告或 Remark。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R^{\\mathrm{remaining483}}_{72}\">\\(\\mathcal R^{\\mathrm{remaining483}}_{72}\\)</span> 为下式给出的字符串—自然数关系；计数函数只在该关系的定义域上取值。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal R^{\\mathrm{remaining483}}_{72}:=\\{&amp;\n\\langle\\ulcorner\\mathtt{reviewed-content}\\urcorner,483\\rangle,\\\\\n&amp;\\langle\\ulcorner\\mathtt{changed-content}\\urcorner,56\\rangle,\\\\\n&amp;\\langle\\ulcorner\\mathtt{retained-content}\\urcorner,427\\rangle,\\\\\n&amp;\\langle\\ulcorner\\mathtt{previous-review-records}\\urcorner,87\\rangle,\\\\\n&amp;\\langle\\ulcorner\\mathtt{total-content}\\urcorner,570\\rangle,\\\\\n&amp;\\langle\\ulcorner\\mathtt{registered-entries}\\urcorner,575\\rangle,\\\\\n&amp;\\langle\\ulcorner\\mathtt{reported-navigation-files}\\urcorner,5\\rangle,\\\\\n&amp;\\langle\\ulcorner\\mathtt{reported-reports}\\urcorner,2\\rangle,\\\\\n&amp;\\langle\\ulcorner\\mathtt{reported-markdown-after}\\urcorner,582\\rangle,\\\\\n&amp;\\langle\\ulcorner\\mathtt{new-content}\\urcorner,0\\rangle,\\\\\n&amp;\\langle\\ulcorner\\mathtt{renamed-content}\\urcorner,0\\rangle,\\\\\n&amp;\\langle\\ulcorner\\mathtt{deleted-content}\\urcorner,0\\rangle\n\\}.\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal R^{\\mathrm{remaining483}}_{72}:=\\{&amp;\n\\langle\\ulcorner\\mathtt{reviewed-content}\\urcorner,483\\rangle,\\\\\n&amp;\\langle\\ulcorner\\mathtt{changed-content}\\urcorner,56\\rangle,\\\\\n&amp;\\langle\\ulcorner\\mathtt{retained-content}\\urcorner,427\\rangle,\\\\\n&amp;\\langle\\ulcorner\\mathtt{previous-review-records}\\urcorner,87\\rangle,\\\\\n&amp;\\langle\\ulcorner\\mathtt{total-content}\\urcorner,570\\rangle,\\\\\n&amp;\\langle\\ulcorner\\mathtt{registered-entries}\\urcorner,575\\rangle,\\\\\n&amp;\\langle\\ulcorner\\mathtt{reported-navigation-files}\\urcorner,5\\rangle,\\\\\n&amp;\\langle\\ulcorner\\mathtt{reported-reports}\\urcorner,2\\rangle,\\\\\n&amp;\\langle\\ulcorner\\mathtt{reported-markdown-after}\\urcorner,582\\rangle,\\\\\n&amp;\\langle\\ulcorner\\mathtt{new-content}\\urcorner,0\\rangle,\\\\\n&amp;\\langle\\ulcorner\\mathtt{renamed-content}\\urcorner,0\\rangle,\\\\\n&amp;\\langle\\ulcorner\\mathtt{deleted-content}\\urcorner,0\\rangle\n\\}.\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R^{\\mathrm{remaining483}}_{72}\\subseteq\\mathbb S\\times\\omega,\\qquad\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathcal R^{\\mathrm{remaining483}}_{72})=\\{k\\in\\mathbb S:\\exists n\\in\\omega\\ (\\langle k,n\\rangle\\in\\mathcal R^{\\mathrm{remaining483}}_{72})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal R^{\\mathrm{remaining483}}_{72}\\subseteq\\mathbb S\\times\\omega,\\qquad\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathcal R^{\\mathrm{remaining483}}_{72})=\\{k\\in\\mathbb S:\\exists n\\in\\omega\\ (\\langle k,n\\rangle\\in\\mathcal R^{\\mathrm{remaining483}}_{72})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RecordedCount}_{\\mathrm{remaining483}}(k):=\\iota n\\in\\omega\\ (\\langle k,n\\rangle\\in\\mathcal R^{\\mathrm{remaining483}}_{72})\\quad(k\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathcal R^{\\mathrm{remaining483}}_{72})).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{RecordedCount}_{\\mathrm{remaining483}}(k):=\\iota n\\in\\omega\\ (\\langle k,n\\rangle\\in\\mathcal R^{\\mathrm{remaining483}}_{72})\\quad(k\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathcal R^{\\mathrm{remaining483}}_{72})).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本文件补齐附件中已经链接的历史记录目标。可用依据是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e6c99e2646691c7d\" href=\"?note=e6c99e2646691c7d\" title=\"72-df-book-catalog\">72-df-book-catalog</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6aa9c9e25ba49583\" href=\"?note=6aa9c9e25ba49583\" title=\"72-df-navigation-index\">72-df-navigation-index</a> 和 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4d85a6a31705a214\" href=\"?note=4d85a6a31705a214\" title=\"72-Handbook-Proof-Theory-Buss-MOC\">72-Handbook-Proof-Theory-Buss-MOC</a> 中同名历史小节的重复摘要。这里恢复的是这些摘要能够支持的有限记录，不是缺失原报告的逐字副本。</p>\n<p>原摘要声称审阅 483 个内容文件，其中修改 56 个、保留 427 个，并把先前 87 个审阅记录计入合计 570 个。原摘要同时声明没有新建、改名或删除内容文件。逐篇证据、源页和 56 项修改清单未随本次附件提供，故本记录只保留可恢复的摘要数据。</p>\n<p>表中键互异，每个键恰有一个自然数值，因此计数函数在其显式定义域上存在且唯一。历史声称中的文件数量可能与本次附件基线不同；两者不能混用。本文件不充当任何数学定理的证明依赖。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-book-catalog","status":"resolved","id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"本文件补齐附件中已经链接的历史记录目标。可用依据是 [[72-df-book-catalog]]、[[72-df-navigation-index]] 和 [[72-Handbook-Proof-Theory-Buss-MOC]] 中同名历史小节的重复摘要。这里恢复的是这些摘要能够支持的有限记录，不是缺失原报告的逐字副本。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-navigation-index","status":"resolved","id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"本文件补齐附件中已经链接的历史记录目标。可用依据是 [[72-df-book-catalog]]、[[72-df-navigation-index]] 和 [[72-Handbook-Proof-Theory-Buss-MOC]] 中同名历史小节的重复摘要。这里恢复的是这些摘要能够支持的有限记录，不是缺失原报告的逐字副本。","embed":false},{"target":"72-Handbook-Proof-Theory-Buss-MOC","status":"resolved","id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-3","targetAn